OL,3,GNEWSAWales risks raising one of the
OL,4,Aunhealthiest generations in decades,
OL,5,Adoctors warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe health of children in Wales is
OL,8,F"shocking" and outcomes for young
OL,9,Fpeople are worsening or slowing down in
OL,10,Fmany areas, children's doctors have
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe Royal College of Paediatrics and
OL,14,FChild Health (RCPCH) in Wales said
OL,15,Fwithout urgent action Wales risked
OL,16,F"raising one of the unhealthiest
OL,17,Fgenerations of children in decades".
OL,19,FIt said the effect was most sharply
OL,20,Ffelt in deprived areas.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
