OL,3,GNEWSAWales risks raising one of the
OL,4,Aunhealthiest generations in decades,
OL,5,Adoctors warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh government said it would
OL,8,Fconsider the findings "carefully", and
OL,9,Fthat it wanted to deliver a "sustained
OL,10,Fnational focus on babies, children, and
OL,11,Fyoung people's health".
